Archived dead code — removed from public/app.js on cleanup.
Pre-redesign inline SVG nav icon set. The sidebar switched to Lucide
(`data-lucide="..."` + lucide.createIcons()) during the QStock Redesign
pass, but the old per-route SVG icon strings and the `navIcon()` lookup
that rendered them were left behind, unused. Kept `sun`/`moon`/`grid`/
`rows`/`send` in ICON since those are still used (theme toggle, notes
view switch, send button).

const navIcon = (route) => ICON[route] || ICON.dashboard;

